# An example site for the lean-pool installers (deploy/install/README.md): copy this directory, change its
# values, and give it to the installers with --site DIR. They read it and never run it; each value is checked
# for its shape.
#   SITE_PREFIX           the first part of every image and container name (leanpool/kimina:TAG,
#                         leanpool-kimina-upstream, leanpool-proxy-upstream), and the name of the helpers' directory on
#                         the host (/usr/local/lib/leanpool). Lower-case letters, digits, '_' and '-'.
#   SITE_LABEL            the owner the ufw rules' comments and the installed systemd units' descriptions name
#   SITE_DOOR_KEY_MARKER  text the comment of the operator's key must hold (install.sh --operator-key FILE): a
#                         re-run and --uninstall find the door's line in authorized_keys by it
#   SITE_LAN_DOMAIN       the LAN's domain: a box called NAME is reached as NAME.<this>
SITE_PREFIX=leanpool
SITE_LABEL=leanpool
SITE_DOOR_KEY_MARKER=leanpool-operator
SITE_LAN_DOMAIN=lan
